;Description
:This template is used to link to a Bento.me profile page.
;Syntax
:Place <code><nowiki>{{Bento|<profilename>}}</nowiki></code> and substitute <profilename> with the latter part of the Bento profile url (e.g., if the link is https://bento.me/angxxangie, the <profilename> will be "angxxangie"). If necessary, use the article's talk page to discuss further details.

;Example<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:<pre>{{Bento|angxxangie|anG twitcast description}}</pre>

;Will result in<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Bento|angxxangie|anG twitcast description}}

;note<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:description field is optional.

